    {"type": "cause", "text": "Sales and marketing fell $42.4 million on timing of marketing events, lower advertising investment and prior-year restructuring charges [P22]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Net margin of -7.8% beat operating margin by 1.2pp, helped by $96.7 million of debt-extinguishment gains in other income [F50][F30][P18]."},
    {"type": "judgement", "text": "The margin improvement is real but still leaves the company at the 0th percentile against internet peers, whose median operating margin is 20.3% [D570][D571]."}
