    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Operating cash flow of $656.2 million and free cash flow of $437.2 million both exceeded the $460.5 million net loss in FY2025 [F80][F100][F40]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "Operating cash flow rose on non-cash stock-based compensation of $1.0 billion, D&A of $163.6 million and $96.7 million of debt-extinguishment gains [P13]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Free cash flow margin reached a window high of 7.4%, against a -4.1% median [D393][D560][D561]."},
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Capex was 3.7% of revenue and 1.34x D&A, with purchases mainly for leased-facility improvements [D392][D395][P10]."}
  ]},
  {"key": "balance_sheet", "title": "Balance sheet and capital allocation", "sentences": [
    {"type": "comparison", "text": "Net cash swung from $1.44 billion in FY2021 to net debt of $596.3 million in FY2025, the fourth straight year of deterioration [D211][D399][R3]."},
    {"type": "cause", "text": "In February 2025 the company issued $1.50 billion of 2033 Notes and repurchased $1.4 billion of 2026-2028 notes for cash [P2][P1]."},
